            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Hanae/hanae_growup_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "I'm always full of energy, but now I'm more energetic than usual."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 23002,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Hanae_Growup_2",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Hanae/hanae_growup_2",
            "LocalizeEN": "It would be nice if there wasn't a single person feeling unwell. Why don't we make it happen, me and you?"
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 23002,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Hanae_Growup_3",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Hanae/hanae_growup_3",
            "LocalizeEN": "I will work harder, for Sensei, and to become a junior that my seniors can be proud of."
        },
        {
            "CharacterId": 23002,
            "DialogCategory": "Growup",
            "VoiceClip": "Hanae_Growup_4",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_Hanae/hanae_growup_4",
            "LocalizeEN": "I make mistakes, but I don't get discouraged because Sensei will help me."
        },
        {
